  "name": "Make event polling merge-safe",
  "slug": "make-event-polling-merge-safe",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "Replace scalar ULID polling checkpoints with a versioned merge-safe cursor protocol that cannot permanently miss late-merged events.",
    "details_md": "",
    "acceptance": [
      "Polling discovers events merged later from old clocks, independent origins, and empty polls without replay loss.",
      "Page limits advance only across returned events; serialized cursors validate strictly and remain bounded with a documented policy.",
      "Legacy scalar --since remains explicitly snapshot-only and migration/backcompat is fail-loud.",
      "Storage/remote/CLI JSON contracts and docs describe the actual guarantee."
